# personal-skills.manifest — Skills managed by install-personal-agents-hub.sh
# Source-of-truth (SoT) lives in shared/gsd or ~/.agents/skills.
# Platform overlays MUST NOT carry copies of these; install-personal-agents-hub.sh
# assembles them into ~/.agents/skills, ~/.cursor/skills, ~/.claude/skills.
#
# Format: <skill-name> <source-type> <source-relative-path>
#   source-type: assembled | flat | external
#   assembled  = built from SKILL.body.md + wrapper via assemble-skill
#   flat       = copied verbatim from source-relative-path/SKILL.md
#   external   = lives in ~/.agents/skills already; hub only bridges
#
# Lines starting with # are comments. Blank lines ignored.

# --- Assembled skills (GSD workflow) ---
do-next               assembled   idea/do-next/templates
do-next-runner         assembled   idea/do-next-runner/templates
gsd-plan-milestone     assembled   skills/gsd-plan-milestone
gsd-advance-unit       assembled   skills/gsd-advance-unit

# --- Flat skills (single SKILL.md, no assembly) ---
ticket-to-plan         flat        skills/ticket-to-plan
verified-pr-review     flat        skills/verified-pr-review
graphify-obsidian      flat        skills/graphify-obsidian
configure-client-project flat        skills/configure-client-project

# Playbook-operator only — not installed to client repos via install-workflow-tools.sh

# --- External skills (managed outside playbook, bridge only) ---
# Add personal skills here that live in ~/.agents/skills and need
# Cursor/Claude bridges but are NOT sourced from this repo.
# Example:
# my-custom-skill      external    -
